        },
        {
          "text": "Nito kebebertab kaiilset ne bo Aron, ak kebebertab kaiilset ne bo werikyik, che bunu kagochinoik che kigochin Jehovah, kobunei mat, eng’ betut ne kiindoi inendet ichek koboisiechi Jehovah eng’ boisietab tiseinatet; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
