          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "che king’at Jehovah lagokab Israel kole kigochi, eng’ betut ne kiili inendet ichek. Ng’atutiet nito agoi koigeny eng’ ibinwekwak tugul.",
          "type": "text",
